,{"page":7,"title":"A bird is awakened by an elephant","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":8,"title":"A bird and its nest fall from a tree","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":9,"title":"An elephant scratches its back against a tree","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":10,"title":"A bird flies across a window","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":11,"title":"A bird builds a nest on a window","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":12,"title":"A bird sleeps in its new nest","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":13,"title":"A man with a white turban stares at a nest","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":14,"title":"A man painting a building throws a nest away","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":15,"title":"A man paints a building","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":16,"title":"A bird spots a balloon","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":17,"title":"A bird spots a green and pink balloon","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":18,"title":"A bird looks down at many balloons in the sky","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":19,"title":"A bird looks at many balloons","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"},{"page":20,"title":"A bird resting in a nest floating with balloons","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2015"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಚಳಿಗಾಲ ಬರುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಒಂದು ಹಕ್ಕಿ ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟಲು ನಿರ್ಧರಿಸಿತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p02.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದು ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಕಡ್ಡಿಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿಸಿ, ತನ್ನ ಗೂಡನ್ನು ಚೆಂದವಾಗಿ ಕಟ್ಟಿತು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p03.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಕ್ಕಿ; ಕಾಳಜಿಯಿಂದ, ಕಷ್ಟಪಟ್ಟು ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟಿದೆ. ಬೆಚ್ಚಗೆ, ಆರಾಮಾಗಿದೆ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p04.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಕ್ಕಿಗೆ ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿದೆ. ಅದು ಮಲಗಿ, ಚಳಿಗಾಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಚ್ಚಗಿರಬಹುದು ಎಂದು ಹಗಲುಗನಸು ಕಾಣತೊಡಗಿತು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಕ್ಕಿ ನಿದ್ರಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವಾಗ, ಏನೋ ಅಲುಗಾಡಿದ ಹಾಗಾಯಿತು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p06.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ಬಹುಶಃ ಗಾಳಿಗೆ ಗೂಡು ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಅಲುಗಾಡುತ್ತಿರಬೇಕು,” ಎಂದು ಯೋಚಿಸಿತು ಹಕ್ಕಿ.","ಆದರೆ, ಜೋರು ಜೋರಾಗಿಯೇ ಅಲುಗಾಡಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು ಗೂಡು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p07.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಕೂಡಲೇ ಹಕ್ಕಿ ಹೊರಗೆ ಹಾರಿತು. ಮರುಕ್ಷಣ, ಗೂಡು ನೆಲಕ್ಕೆ ಬಿದ್ದಿತು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಒಂದು ಆನೆ ಮರಕ್ಕೆ ಬೆನ್ನು ಉಜ್ಜುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಅದನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ","ಪಕ್ಷಿಗೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಬೇಸರವಾಯಿತು.","ಸಿಟ್ಟಿನಿಂದ ಆನೆಗೆ ಬಯ್ದಿತು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p09.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದು ಹೊಸ ಜಾಗವನ್ನು ಹುಡುಕಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು.","ಆನೆ ಬಂದು ಬೆನ್ನು ಉಜ್ಜಲು","ಆಗದ ಜಾಗ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p10.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದು ಹೊಸ ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಬೇಗ ಬೇಗ ಹೊಸ ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟಿಕೊಂಡಿತು. ಅದರಲ್ಲಿ ಆರಾಮಾಗಿ ಮಲಗಿತು."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p12.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಆಗ ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು ಕಾಣಿಸಿದವು. ಅದು ಗಾಬರಿಯಿಂದ ಹಾರಿಹೋಯಿತು."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅದು ಪೇಂಟರ್.","ಅವನು ಗೂಡನ್ನು ಕಿತ್ತೆಸೆದು,","ಬ್ರಷ್ ಕೈಗೆತ್ತಿಕೊಂಡ. ಗೋಡೆಗೆ","ಬಣ್ಣ ಬಳೆಯಲಾರಂಭಿಸಿದ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p14.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಕ್ಕಿ ಸಿಟ್ಟಿನಿಂದ ಮನುಷ್ಯನನ್ನು ಬಯ್ದಿತು. ನಂತರ ದುಃಖದಿಂದ ಹಾರಿಹೋಯಿತು."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p15.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಾರುತ್ತ ಹೋಗುವಾಗ ಅದಕ್ಕೆ, ಗಾಳಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ತೇಲುತ್ತಿರುವ ಒಂದು ಬಲೂನ್ ಕಂಡಿತು."]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p16.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ನಂತರ ಇನ್ನೊಂದು!"]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p17.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದು ಕೆಳಗೆ ನೋಡಿತು.","ಅಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ತುಂಬಾ ಬಲೂನ್‌ಗಳಿದ್ದವು!"]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p18.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಬಲೂನ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ ಖುಷಿಯಾಯಿತು.","ಹಾಗೇ ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಒಂದು ಉಪಾಯ ಕೂಡ ಹೊಳೆಯಿತು."]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592973-haaraaduva-goodu/p19.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅದು ಮತ್ತೆ ಗೂಡು ಕಟ್ಟಿತು. ಗಾಳಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ತೇಲುವ ಗೂಡು.","ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಯಾರೂ ತೊಂದರೆ ಕೊಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."]}],"wordCount":159}